You just have to search for it.  Magic mapping doesn't tell you where
all the traps are, only the rooms & corridors &c.  To find all the
traps on the level, use a crystal ball (look for '^') or a cursed
scroll of gold detection.  You could also use a wand of secret door
detection, or carefully step on every open space on the level.  When
it said 'magic transporter,' it didn't mean level teleport trap, it
meant magic transporter.  There is one on the level.  Trust me.

